blurb = "Depicts a hillside near Kanaya (in present-day Shizuoka prefecture), looking southeast across the Ōi river. Carrying people across this wide river was major business in Kanaya at the time.

The choice of angle for this view is unusual, as it leaves Mount Fuji just out of frame on the left."
